{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bifrost-provider-harness-2026-05",
    "name": "Bifrost Provider Harness",
    "description": "Smoke-test harness exercising every Bifrost provider surface.\n\nCovers:\n1. Native Bifrost API (`/v1/chat/completions`, `/v1/responses`).\n2. Drop-in integrations: `/openai`, `/anthropic`, `/bedrock`, `/genai`, plus Azure (via `/openai/openai/deployments/...`) and Vertex (via `/genai`).\n3. Cross-Model harness: a single endpoint (`POST /v1/chat/completions`) called with 10 latest-generation models per provider, demonstrating Bifrost's `provider/model` unified-routing format across OpenAI, Anthropic, Bedrock, Gemini, and Vertex.\n\nSet the `baseUrl` and provider key variables before running. Run end-to-end with `make run-provider-harness-test` from the repo root.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Status code is 2xx', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.code, 'expected a 2xx response, got ' + pm.response.code).to.be.below(400);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "openaiKey", "value": "sk-replace-me", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "anthropicKey", "value": "sk-ant-replace-me", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "genaiKey", "value": "AIza-replace-me", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bedrockModel", "value": "anthropic.claude-opus-4-7-v1:0", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "azureDeployment", "value": "gpt-4o", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "azureApiVersion", "value": "2024-10-21", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "genaiModel", "value": "gemini-2.5-pro", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "vertexModel", "value": "gemini-2.5-pro", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Native Bifrost API",
      "description": "Bifrost's own OpenAI-shaped surface. Use a `provider/model` string in the `model` field to route to any configured backend.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/chat/completions",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"openai/gpt-4o-mini\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Say hello in one short sentence.\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/chat/completions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "chat", "completions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/responses",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"openai/gpt-4o-mini\",\n  \"input\": \"Say hello in one short sentence.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/responses",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "responses"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. OpenAI drop-in (/openai)",
      "description": "Mirrors the OpenAI HTTP surface. Existing OpenAI SDKs work by pointing `base_url` at `{{baseUrl}}/openai`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /openai/v1/chat/completions",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{openaiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello from OpenAI drop-in.\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/openai/v1/chat/completions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["openai", "v1", "chat", "completions"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /openai/v1/responses",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{openaiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"gpt-4o-mini\",\n  \"input\": \"Hello from OpenAI Responses API.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/openai/v1/responses",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["openai", "v1", "responses"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Anthropic drop-in (/anthropic)",
      "description": "Mirrors the Anthropic Messages API. Use `x-api-key` and `anthropic-version` headers as you would against api.anthropic.com.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /anthropic/v1/messages",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-api-key", "value": "{{anthropicKey}}" },
              { "key": "anthropic-version", "value": "2023-06-01" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"model\": \"claude-opus-4-7\",\n  \"max_tokens\": 1024,\n  \"messages\": [\n    { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello from Anthropic drop-in.\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/anthropic/v1/messages",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["anthropic", "v1", "messages"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Bedrock drop-in (/bedrock)",
      "description": "Mirrors AWS Bedrock's Converse API. Auth/credentials are resolved by Bifrost from its provider config (or IAM/env if Bedrock provider config is nil).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /bedrock/model/{modelId}/converse",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": [{ \"text\": \"Hello from Bedrock Converse.\" }]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"inferenceConfig\": {\n    \"maxTokens\": 1024\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bedrock/model/{{bedrockModel}}/converse",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["bedrock", "model", "{{bedrockModel}}", "converse"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Azure (via /openai deployments)",
      "description": "Azure OpenAI has no separate top-level route - it's served by the OpenAI integration with the deployment-style path. Replace `{{azureDeployment}}` with the deployment name configured in your Azure resource.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /openai/openai/deployments/{deployment}/chat/completions",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "api-key", "value": "{{openaiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"messages\": [\n    { \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello from Azure deployment.\" }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/openai/openai/deployments/{{azureDeployment}}/chat/completions?api-version={{azureApiVersion}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["openai", "openai", "deployments", "{{azureDeployment}}", "chat", "completions"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "api-version", "value": "{{azureApiVersion}}" }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Google GenAI drop-in (/genai)",
      "description": "Mirrors Google GenAI's `generateContent` API. Send the model + action via the `:generateContent` suffix on the path.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /genai/v1beta/models/{model}:generateContent",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-goog-api-key", "value": "{{genaiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [{ \"text\": \"Hello from GenAI generateContent.\" }]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/genai/v1beta/models/{{genaiModel}}:generateContent",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["genai", "v1beta", "models", "{{genaiModel}}:generateContent"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Vertex (via /genai)",
      "description": "Bifrost surfaces Vertex AI through the same GenAI router; use a Vertex-style model identifier (or rely on Bifrost's provider routing in your config) and the `generateContent` path.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /genai/v1beta/models/{vertexModel}:generateContent",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "x-goog-api-key", "value": "{{genaiKey}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"contents\": [\n    {\n      \"parts\": [{ \"text\": \"Hello from Vertex via GenAI.\" }]\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/genai/v1beta/models/{{vertexModel}}:generateContent",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["genai", "v1beta", "models", "{{vertexModel}}:generateContent"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
